    "title": "Endowment honors husband and wife educators - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kristie Bowles kbowles@tiogapublishing.com ,\n15 hours ago MANSFIELD — Remember the little things. That was a special saying between Lana Bozzo and her grandmother, Marianne. Before her death in 2023, Marianne wanted to make sure her husband Paul’s memory lived on, providing opportunities to graduating seniors at North Penn-Mansfield and North Penn-Liberty high schools, through an endowment scholarship in his name. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
